{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（15日）晚上7時許，警方接獲報案，指一輛私家車懷疑於觀塘危險駕駛，並先後於雲漢街撞到一輛私家車及一輛貨車，再於瑞和街撞到一輛停泊在路邊的私家車。</p><p>警方到場拘捕涉案26歲非華裔男司機，並於其車上搜獲懷疑毒品。</p><p>案件詳情仍待調查。</p><p>事件中無人受傷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T16:19:47.451751+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:26:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T11:37:39.934563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T16:17:40.278928+00:00","content_hash":"32dbbf85b5d77ec69164a462105df9c32e53e812e7faf0a0be3957b26cbac20d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}